  "description": "CDN access-log ingestion adapter for ToolUp.MediaLibrary (Phase 742). Field-mapped parsers for delimited and newline-delimited-JSON access logs, turning whatever field set a deployment's edge delivery emits into DeliveredRecord values; plus CallbackLogSource and CallbackScopeResolver, the two delivered-egress seams over plain callbacks. Field names, timestamp shapes and cache-status vocabularies are all data — no cloud SDK dependency and no vendor-specific code path.",
